{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "Please send me the report before the meeting starts tomorrow.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_01"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "The weather has been hot, but the evening breeze is nice.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_02"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "I need to visit the clinic because I have had a headache since Monday.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_03"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "Our neighbor bought a new car and drove it through the village yesterday.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_04"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "The children are reading in the classroom while the rain falls outside.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_05"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "I left my notebook on the chair near the window.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_06"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "We should check the map before we start the journey.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_07"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "The shopkeeper said the bread arrived early this morning.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_08"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "If you see Samuel, tell him that I will call him later.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_09"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "I prefer tea in the morning, but my sister likes coffee.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_10"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "The generator stopped working when the lights went out.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_11"}
{"language": "liberian_english", "text": "After lunch, we will walk to the library and return before dark.", "style": "english_tts", "source": "ood_plain_english", "source_id": "eng_ood_12"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "I went to the market this morning and the price of rice has gone up again.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_01"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "My brother said the bus will leave before six, so we should not be late.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_02"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "If the rain stops, we can carry the chairs outside and sit there.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_03"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "I don't know who took my phone, but I want it back today.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_04"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "The teacher told us to bring our books tomorrow.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_05"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "Auntie Mary cooked plenty soup, so everybody can eat.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_06"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "When you reach Monrovia, call me and tell me where you are staying.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_07"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "The road is bad, but the driver says he can still pass.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_08"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "I need small change to buy bread at the shop.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_09"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "We are planning a small party for the children on Saturday.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_10"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "He forgot his keys under the table, and now he cannot enter the house.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_11"}
{"language": "kolokwa", "text": "I will meet you at the station after the sun goes down.", "style": "kolokwa", "source": "ood_kolokwa", "source_id": "kol_ood_12"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Kè wó nɛɛ̀ kà wá, nɛ́ li dɔɔ̀ kɔlɛ̀ wó yɛ̀.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_01"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Də̀ mɛ̀ɛ́ kɔ́ pɛ́yà, pá dɛ̀ pá pɔ̀ à tiè.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_02"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Nɛ́ kólɛ̀ láá lɔ́ gá, kélé mɛ́nɛ̀ɛ́ kà bɔ̃.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_03"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Kɛ̀ gɛ̀nɛ̀ nɛ̄, ná pá li-mà dɔ̄ɔ̄-wò li kà.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_04"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Píè lá mɛ̀ɛ̀ tōò nà dáká kò-wò kə̀ kà.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_05"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Kɔlɛ̀ zé má, zí wò yɛ̀ wó là lí kà.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_06"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Bɛ̀ɛ́ wó vɛ̄ kà lɔ, kéwó lá kà wà wò.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_07"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Mɛ́ pá wè liɛ̄ lí tɔ́nɔ́ níɛ gā wá pɛ̀.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_08"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Mɛ̄ɛ́ dówò mɔ̄lɔ̄ zú, nàá kò lɔ́ kɔ̀ kà.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_09"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Mɛ́ nɛ̀ zù yɛ bɔ́lɔ́, kpà wè li kà kólɔ́ wó.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_10"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Nɛ́ dɔ̀, nɛ̄ɛ̄ lá wá pá wà pá kɔ̀ɔ̀ wá.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_11"}
{"language": "loma", "text": "Wó yɛ yí kà, nà-wò, wó pá láá pá mɛ̀.", "style": "loma", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "loma_ood_12"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Bɛyɛi, dɛŋ ka pɔn kɔw laa, dɛŋ ka pɔn bɛyɛi bɛ.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_01"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Kɔle mɛn pɛlɛ bɛ kɔɔ long kɛɛi la, da pɛ yɛlɛi.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_02"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Mɛ lii yeeŋ kpaa, mɛ dãŋ pɛ mɛ yili, a kɛ mɛ wɛɛ.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_03"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Ŋa tɛ a gɛ ŋa, ŋa pãŋ lɔ, yii a lɔŋ a tãa.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_04"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Pɛlɛ long gbaa teli, koo yɛ fɛɛi la, koo da lɛ wɛ.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_05"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Long gbaa teli gɔw, yɛ pɛlɛ a loŋ, bã tɔ loŋ lɔ.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_06"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Tãa long yɛi, lɔŋ da kili gɔŋ long kpɛ, lɔŋ yã kili.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_07"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Yii, yii, ke yɛ ŋilɛ, gɛ gɛ ŋa, teli mɛ gbaa long.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_08"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Nɛ long da wɛ̃ɛ la, nɛ long maŋ yɛ kɛ dãa gbaa da.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_09"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Tii long teli bɔ̃ɔ, tii ka pɛ gbaa long la da, gbaa da.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_10"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Mɛ kpãŋ tã, mɛ kpɛ̃ɛ mɛ wɛ, kooko da fɛ pɛ yɛ naŋ.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_11"}
{"language": "kpelle", "text": "Waa wɛɛ, waa pãŋ long teli nɔ, yɛ long long maŋ yɛi.", "style": "kpelle", "source": "ood_gemini", "source_id": "kpelle_ood_12"}
